{
  "_comment": [
    "Reviewed exceptions for tools/check_i18n.py. Every entry is a decision, not",
    "a way to make a finding go away. The coordinator owns this file.",
    "",
    "_global applies to every addon, for terms Odoo exports into each module's",
    "catalogue separately but whose French is the English word. Terms marked",
    "below as verified appear identically in the French catalogues shipped with",
    "the Odoo 19 image (docs/i18n/odoo_fr_reference.json); the rest are ordinary",
    "French words that happen to be spelled as in English. Neither kind is an",
    "untranslated string.",
    "",
    "Per addon:",
    "  identical  msgids whose French translation is legitimately the same string",
    "             as the English source: brands, acronyms, legal references, and",
    "             technical tokens that appear as UI labels.",
    "  stale      msgids kept in fr.po although the current POT no longer has",
    "             them. Temporary by design; each needs a reason and a removal.",
    "  source     escape hatches for the source scanner.",
    "    files    repository-relative path prefixes that hold data rather than",
    "             interface: protocol constant tables, device capability maps.",
    "    texts    exact literals that stay English everywhere, such as barcode",
    "             symbology names and device model names."
  ],
